====================================================================

.env.example - Environment Variables Template

Copy this file to .env and fill in the values for local development.

====================================================================

----------------------------------------------------

1. DATABASE CREDENTIALS (Used by Docker Compose & Django)

----------------------------------------------------

POSTGRES_DB= db_placehold
POSTGRES_USER= user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_strong_local_password

----------------------------------------------------

2. DJANGO APPLICATION SECRETS (REQUIRED)

----------------------------------------------------

GENERATE a random 50+ character string for this key!

SECRET_KEY=PLACEHOLDER_GENERATE_A_RANDOM_STRING
DEBUG=True

----------------------------------------------------

3. CONNECTION SETTINGS

----------------------------------------------------

DB_HOST=db
DB_PORT=5432
WEB_PORT=8000

----------------------------------------------------

4. EXTERNAL API KEYS (Required for fetching media data)

----------------------------------------------------

MOVIE_API_KEY=PLACEHOLDER_TMDG_API_KEY
GAME_API_KEY=PLACEHOLDER_IGDB_API_KEY